
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This directory contains the pointing history, efficiency functions for each
block, and the list of detected objects for the High Latitude survey (Petit
et al. 2016, AJ), observed in the MegaPrime r filter.

The content of this directory is:

HiLat
   \---------- README.hilat (this file) Describes the content of the directory
    \--------- pointings.list           List of pointings and times of the
     \                                  survey
      \------- HLnX-smooth.eff          Efficiency function for block HLnX,
       \                                where n gives the year (200n) and X a
        \                               letter; the 2009 block HL9 is split
         \                              into HL901 to HL922
          \--- HiLat.detections         List of objects really detected in
                                        HiLat, with their dynamical class if
                                        known, magnitude at detection, rate of
                                        motion, H mag, and more.

See CFEPS_g/README.formats for the format of a survey "block".

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
